{
    "title": "Panda Master: Legend of Stick",
    "description": "Adventure awaits in Panda Master: Legend of Stick, a mobile action game where the cutest critter becomes the fiercest fighter!\r\n\r\nBecome a playful panda cub with a hidden talent for brawling. When a mysterious force threatens the peace of the bamboo forest, he must rise to the challenge and become the Panda Master!\r\n\r\nKung Fu and Stick Training: Become a Master!\r\nTrain with Master: Learn basic swipe controls and tap to unleash powerful moves.\r\nPractice in the Training Courtyard: Hone your skills against training dummies and unlock new combos as you progress.\r\nMaster different Kung Fu Styles: Each style offers unique attacks and advantages. Experiment and find your favorite!\r\n\r\nCampaign Mode: Fight for Peace!\r\nBattle your way through iconic locations: Travel from the Jade Palace to defend villages and face off against villains from the movies.\r\nLevel up and Earn Rewards: Each victory earns you experience points to level up, unlock new abilities, and upgrade your stats.\r\nBoss Battles: Test Your Might! Face off against epic bosses with unique fighting styles and special attacks. Learn their patterns and unleash your Kung Fu fury to emerge victorious!\r\n\r\nPanfu Basics: Become a Brawling Panda!\r\nVirtual Joystick Movement: Use the on-screen button to move Panda around the beautiful bamboo world.\r\nSwipe and Tap Attacks: Chain together simple swipes and taps to unleash powerful combos and defeat enemies.\r\nSpecial Abilities: Each animal companion you befriend has a unique special ability that can be activated during combat.\r\n\r\nExploring the Bamboo Forest: Adventure Awaits!\r\nStory Quests: Follow the storyline, complete quests, and uncover the secrets that threaten the bamboo forest.\r\nSide Quests and Challenges: Find hidden quests and challenges throughout the world to earn extra rewards and test your skills.\r\nMini-games: Unwind between battles with fun and engaging mini-games that earn you special items and resources.\r\nBuilding the Perfect Panda Team!\r\n\r\nEnjoy Panda Master: Legend of Stick and having fun",
    "descriptionHTML": "Adventure awaits in Panda Master: Legend of Stick, a mobile action game where the cutest critter becomes the fiercest fighter!<br><br>Become a playful panda cub with a hidden talent for brawling. When a mysterious force threatens the peace of the bamboo forest, he must rise to the challenge and become the Panda Master!<br><br>Kung Fu and Stick Training: Become a Master!<br>Train with Master: Learn basic swipe controls and tap to unleash powerful moves.<br>Practice in the Training Courtyard: Hone your skills against training dummies and unlock new combos as you progress.<br>Master different Kung Fu Styles: Each style offers unique attacks and advantages. Experiment and find your favorite!<br><br>Campaign Mode: Fight for Peace!<br>Battle your way through iconic locations: Travel from the Jade Palace to defend villages and face off against villains from the movies.<br>Level up and Earn Rewards: Each victory earns you experience points to level up, unlock new abilities, and upgrade your stats.<br>Boss Battles: Test Your Might! Face off against epic bosses with unique fighting styles and special attacks. Learn their patterns and unleash your Kung Fu fury to emerge victorious!<br><br>Panfu Basics: Become a Brawling Panda!<br>Virtual Joystick Movement: Use the on-screen button to move Panda around the beautiful bamboo world.<br>Swipe and Tap Attacks: Chain together simple swipes and taps to unleash powerful combos and defeat enemies.<br>Special Abilities: Each animal companion you befriend has a unique special ability that can be activated during combat.<br><br>Exploring the Bamboo Forest: Adventure Awaits!<br>Story Quests: Follow the storyline, complete quests, and uncover the secrets that threaten the bamboo forest.<br>Side Quests and Challenges: Find hidden quests and challenges throughout the world to earn extra rewards and test your skills.<br>Mini-games: Unwind between battles with fun and engaging mini-games that earn you special items and resources.<br>Building the Perfect Panda Team!<br><br>Enjoy Panda Master: Legend of Stick and having fun",
    "summary": "Master the martial arts and fight in this pawsome mobile action adventure!",
